# Git attributes for the moon_ua_parser workspace.
#
# Patch files under scripts/framework-cache-patches/ must keep their exact
# byte content (LF, no EOL rewriting) or `git apply --check` fails after a
# Windows autocrlf=true checkout. CI applies them with
# `git -c core.autocrlf=false apply`, which pins application config but
# cannot re-checkout an already-mangled file — so the attribute pins the
# file itself (final-review follow-up, 2026-09-13).
*.patch -text
